&lt;p&gt;The DACH team is a highly consultative sales team responsible for both winning new business and driving the growth of Stripe&#39;s most strategic customers across Germany, Austria, and Switzerland. We work with the most ambitious market leaders and high-growth innovators — from Personio , FREE NOW, N26 to Westwing — helping them build the financial infrastructure that powers their next stage of growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stripe&#39;s payments and financial infrastructure is the engine that unlocks new revenue streams, automates complex local compliance, and drives global expansion for the region&#39;s most prominent businesses. This is a pivotal moment for Stripe in DACH — the market opportunity is significant, and we&#39;re looking for someone who wants to help shape it.&lt;/p&gt;
