&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our professional services team combines payments and financial expertise with experience integrating Stripe technology in thousands of projects. We help our customers create marketplaces, launch subscription businesses, expand globally, and more. This team provides critical implementation and post-launch services to help Stripe users maximize long-term value, quickly and confidently.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an experienced Engagement Manager to join our Australia and New Zealand distributed team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Engagement Managers lead complex and multi-faceted project teams that accelerate implementations and drive meaningful growth and innovation on the Stripe platform. As an Engagement Manager at Stripe, you will lead enterprises to become long-term Stripe users and advocates of our products and solutions. Stripe Professional Services provides a rapid path to success and ongoing value for our users.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Engagement Managers enable users and partners to integrate Stripe’s solutions rapidly while delivering immediate impact and measurable value.&lt;/p&gt;
