&lt;li&gt;Experience at highly dynamic, high-growth tech companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great service mentality and track record of building positive relationships with peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to thrive on a high level of autonomy, responsibility and ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative problem solving skills and results driven&lt;/li&gt;
