&lt;li&gt;Communicate success internally through QBRs, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide oversight, guidance, and assistance during the partners sales process to ensure mutual success in joint opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Educate the Stripe sales team on key partner solutions and capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as an advocate for key partners within specific sales regions and identify areas for sales partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate on technical content (sample code, demos, etc.) to show partners how to implement specific use cases or best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide Partner-focused guidance on Stripe’s product through feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
