&lt;li&gt;Track record of operating effectively in highly cross-functional environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity in rapidly-evolving problem spaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical, problem-solving, and decision-making skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sharp written and verbal communication – you can distill complex requirements into clear, accessible language&lt;/li&gt;
