&lt;p&gt;The Risk PMO team supports Stripe’s mission by protecting Stripe’s revenue and driving the cross-functional strategy for Company-level and Org-level OKRs. We are builders and operators leading complex, global initiatives from incubation to full cycle program management. The problems we work on have often never been worked on before and we frequently build 0 → 1 solutions. We do this through a combination of rigorous thinking, strategic alignment, and a user-first approach to solving problems across teams at Stripe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we rapidly grow our company and customer-base, we need ‘full stack’ program management experts with global program experience who easily flex between:&lt;/p&gt;
