&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of financial crime regulatory frameworks, inclusive of BSA Patriot Act, OFAC, and EU Anti-Money Laundering Directives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the financial crime technology stack (including watchlist management systems, case management tooling, transaction monitoring and screening)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
