&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone who meets the minimum requirements to be considered for the role. If you meet these requirements, you are encouraged to apply. The preferred qualifications are a bonus, not a requirement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in a software development role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong coding skills in any programming language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to drive and lead large-scale initiatives that solve critical business challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills across teams and workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of developing and delivering high-quality software using industry best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to make effective tradeoffs that balance business priorities, user experience, and technical sustainability&lt;/li&gt;
