&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Master Communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Stripe is a writing-heavy culture. You must be able to articulate deep technical and strategic concepts through precise, persuasive prose - your narrative docs should be things of beauty.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Agency &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Adept at finding &quot;homes&quot; for initiatives, building consensus across disparate teams, and driving momentum without needing formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
