&lt;p&gt;Stripe is a financial infrastructure platform for businesses. Millions of companies—from the world’s largest enterprises to ambitious startups—use Stripe to accept payments, grow revenue, and accelerate new business. Our mission is to increase the GDP of the internet, and we have a huge amount of important work ahead. This is an opportunity to put the global economy within everyone’s reach while doing the most meaningful work of your career.&lt;/p&gt;
